    "Id": "mechdef_proteus_PT-O",
    "Name": "King Crab PT-O",
    "Details": "The King Crab \"Proteus\" was designed on Mars during the early Clanbuster program as part of attempts to incorporate OmniMech Technology into an already proven design. The name stems from Terran mythology - Proteus was a shapeshifting god of the sea, a fitting name for an OmniMech King Crab.The basic -O model was the earliest working prototype, swapping out much of the internals for OmniMech components, but keeping a similar weapons profile to the original King Crab.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Intimidating</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Proteus"
  },
